          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: بدتر",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بدتر — badtar — \"worse\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دوا لیجیے، ورنہ حالت بدتر ہو گی۔ davā lījiye, varnā hālat badtar ho gī. Take the medicine, or you will get worse."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بدتر (badtar) is usually traced to Persian badtar, \"worse\": bad, \"bad\", with -tar, \"more\", the ending that also makes بہتر, \"better\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
